# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Docker build context exclusions
# Applied when building from the repo root (e.g. coordinator Dockerfile).
# Keeps the context lean — only POM files + src/ directories are copied.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Local Maven build output
**/target/
target/

# Local Maven repository cache
.m2/

# Node dependencies — restored by 'npm ci' inside the build stage
**/node_modules/

# IDE metadata
.idea/
.vscode/
**/*.iml
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings/

# Git internals
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Pre-built distribution (worker uses COPY dist/lib/ explicitly)
# Exclude everything else so only dist/ enters the worker context
dist/native/

# Documentation — not needed at build time
*.md
docs/
specs/
PROCESSING.md
ARCHITECTURE.md

# Logs
*.log
server-output.log

# Test reports
**/surefire-reports/
**/failsafe-reports/

# OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
